            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Keeli"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I served this at a taco bar I planned for work. I didn't realize I didn't have any orange juice so I added 1T of orange liqueur plus a bit of lime juice and zest to brighten up the flavor, then I folded in 1/2 an 8oz container of cool-whip and served with strawberry halves. The dip was light and fluffy with great flavor and not too sweet at all.",
