            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Renae"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Loved it!! I couldn’t find the frozen Margarita mix locally, so I substituted a pre-mixed Margarita w/alcohol. I also added 4oz more of cream cheese to thicken the dip and about 1-2 tsp of sugar additionally, to offset the alcohol in my pre-mix. Served it with Nilla Wafers, Strawberries &amp; fresh cut Pineapple. ??",
